# Search the bounded box for a vehicle pose that brings the locked scene into the arm's reach,
# then move there. The cloud is latched by the caller and is not re-collected during the move.
CloudResult cloud
---
bool success
string message
ParkPose chosen
ParkPose stayed          # what the current pose scores, so the gain from moving is visible

# The same scene, labelled with the frame the arm base stood in when it was latched. The pick
# is planned against a fresh collect taken after the move, not against this; it is kept as the
# reference the fresh measurement is compared with, which is what makes the drive's dead
# reckoning and the scene's own motion visible. When the search elects not to move, this is
# still what gets planned, because nothing has happened to make it stale.
CloudResult locked
---
string stage             # searching, moving
uint32 poses_scored
float64 best_score
